script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ApolloFlame
	"두, 두 번이나 지다니 어떻게 된\n거지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우주가 나 대신\n시리우스가 지배하길\n바라는 건가?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"…그럴 리가…"
	wait10
	" 하지만 사실이다…!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"으하하하하!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"…그렇다면!\n널… 통과시켜 주마!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"시리…"
	wait10
	"우스가… "
	wait10
	"너를\n자신의…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"빠져나갈 수 없는… 블랙홀의\n깊은 곳에서… "
	wait10
	"맞이할 것이다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"으아아아악!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"우… 우리가 이겼어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"정말 아슬아슬했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"칭찬하긴 싫지만,\n정말 강했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그래, 그 녀석보다\n강한 상대는\n없을 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"그럴지도 모르지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 그자의 자존심 때문에\n내 뜻대로 움직이게 하긴\n참 까다로운 말이었지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"누구야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"…시리우스!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
